From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:09:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Draw the 2D on both screens of the DS

The top screen shows the 3D view with the menu, help computer,
inventory, loading plaque and pause over it, the help computer and
inventory at 1:1, and the messages and center prints on a text layer,
wrapped at words to its 32 columns. Without the menu the pause plaque
shows. The touch screen shows the console when it is down or there is no
game, else the status bar at its top, with the picked up item and the
timers below it, and the map and weapons of the DS. scr_showfps shows
the frame rate.
---
